55 steps total (31 original + 6 hardening + 18 roadmap). Phases 7â€“10 ordering logic: automation
(7) multiplies the value of existing workflows; the developer kit (8) creates the node variety
that surfaces the scale problems (9) fixes; distribution (10) wants a stable feature set last. The critical path is 0.1 â†’ 0.2 â†’ 0.4 â†’ 1.2 â†’ 1.6 â†’ 3.1 â†’ 3.2 â†’ 3.3 â†’ 3.5 â†’ 3.6; everything else hangs off it. The two steps to treat with the most care are **3.1** (extracting step functions from the 2,400-line `routes.py` without behavior change) and **4.2** (cache correctness â€” wrong reuse silently corrupts projects).
