_dev\sfx-prompt-preview.md-13-- `tension_riser` (RISER): Long swelling drone or build-up that escalates tension before a reveal. Use sparingly — at most once per video, on a build → climax transition. Pairs naturally with hook or build → climax pivots.
_dev\sfx-prompt-preview.md-14-- `bass_drop_impact` (BASS DROP): Single deep bass impact — the heaviest sting available. Use ONCE per video, on the climax scene only, on the hardest emotional beat. Never on a build scene; never twice.
